  "_aliases_source": "bw-board src/devices/tier3-parts.js registers 74hc595 with BOTH the TI DIP spellings and the abstract gallery ones over the same legs. Physical twins read off that model directly: ser=data (pin 14), srclk=clock (11), rclk=latch (12), and Q_LETTERS[i] = q<i> = Q<i>, so qa=q0=Q0 is pin 15 and qb..qh = q1..q7 = Q1..Q7 are pins 1..7. An alias is a NAME, not a pin: it takes its twin's position and no slot of its own."
